<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1PE" style="id">- Makua Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">1Napeturo</para>
  <para style="toc1">Iwarakha yo upachera i Napeturo</para>
  <para style="toc2">1Napeturo</para>
  <para style="toc3">1Nap</para>
  <para style="mt2">Iwarakha yo upachera i</para>
  <para style="mt1">Napeturo</para>
  <para style="imt">Malhove o uholhelha</para>
  <para style="ip">Iwarakha yo upachera i Napeturo yaalhepiye ni akarumiya Napeturo. Napeturo anochokholha ulhepa iwarakha aya wo wiihimiacha aari apani ni wa apani unrweeha aya iwarakha iyo. Anolhepa iwarakha aya wiira irwee wa attu anrumelhenlhe Kuristo amwarelhe mwiilhaponi mu, ehanne aya “alheto o velhaponi va”. Nhina iwarakha ilha ahohokolhelha venchi uhimiacha nenno nlhove nno wa attu anooshoma (nlhako wo 1:1, 17 ni 2:11). Ukhalhawaya ilha iwarakha ilha iholhikaana ni iwarakha i Napaolo wa attu o Uefeso vakittu vakittu, attu enchi etu anoona wiira iwarakha yo upachera i Napeturo yaalhepiye baada yo iwarakha i Napaolo wa attu o Uefeso, iyaakha yo 65 baada yo uyaria wa Kuristo. Napeturo aalhempe iwarakha ilha anari iwani yo Urumi uneehana aya, Ubabeli (nlhako wo 5:13).</para>
  <para style="ip">Napeturo ahohimia wiira alhempe ilha iwarakha ilha wo nlhatu wo “uhelhani nrima ni uhiimiechesherani wiira ulha phi nnema wo ikeekhene wa Nlhuku” (nlhako wo 5:12). Tho, chihaawo chittu chinolhikaana mu iwarakha yo upachera i Napeturo (2:11-3:7) ni iwarakha i Napaolo wa attu o Uefeso (5:18-6:9) ni iwarakha i Napaolo wa attu o Ukolosai (3:18-4:6). Nhina chechiyo milhako miraru chiyo, aholhehera mwaha unaacha wiiwanana mmilhokoni ni uvarechesha malhehero a attu o ikuru yo utawara. Thothoni tho, anowaahelha mirima attu anrumelhenlhe Kuristo uvilhelha vanohuva aya ukhalhawaya umalhelha wo chittu uhaatameria (nlhako wo 4:1).</para>
  <para style="iot">Chiri nhina</para>
  <para style="io">Napeturo anowiihimiacha anene ni waashikuria oshoma aya (nlhako wo 1:1-2).</para>
  <para style="io">Anonshukuru Nlhuku wo mwaha wo noopo nokawaniya, ni maana aya nhina ukumi aya (nlhako wo 1:3-2:10).</para>
  <para style="io">Tho anowaalhaka attu anrumelhenlhe Kuristo iphiro yo ukhalha rata velhaponi ni waahimeria mwaha wo ukhalhiya makhalhelho anolhoka, wa ntu ni ahanu awe, ipotta ni nkunya aya (nlhako wo 2:11-4:11).</para>
  <para style="io">Baada yo vavawo, Napeturo anowaahelha attu mirima cho uvilhelha ikatema vanohuva aya (nlhako wo 4:12-5:11).</para>
  <para style="io">Anoomalhiha iwarakha aya (nlhako wo 5:12-14).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1PE 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 1:1" />Mii Peturo, karumiya awe Yesu Kuristo,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1PE 1:1">Kinoowiiha iwarakha uwaninyu mwaatti attu nthanlhiye ni Nlhuku, mmwareelhe nkhalhaka thoko alheto ilhapo cho Uponto, Ugalatiya, Ukapadokiya, Uasia ni Ubithiniya. <verse eid="1PE 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 1:2" />Nlhuku Athithi ahoukumihani mwaatti wo uttuna wawe, nkamwaahapihiya wo Iphumu awe, mmwe mwanrumelhelha Yesu Kuristo ni uhapihiya wo iphome awe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1PE 1:2">Kinoulhapelhelhani nnema ni mpuha mwinchi.<verse eid="1PE 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nikhulhuvelho no machiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 1:3" />Atotopelhiye Nlhuku, Athumwanaya Athithi Yesu Kuristo! Ukhalhawaya wo ikiriri awe yulhupalhe honiyara wo nayelhi wo unhihimusha Yesu Kuristo nnookhwani. Honivaha nikhulhuvelho no ukumi, <verse eid="1PE 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 1:4" />ninoweherera ihu upatta. Nhakhu uhinonta ama unanara ama uwalhawalha ushungiye wa attu awe. Nnema unishungenre awe Nlhuku wiirimu. <verse eid="1PE 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 1:5" />Ni inyu mwaatti nnoshungiya wo machiri a Nlhuku wo upisha nrima mpaka vanohalha inyu upatakulhelhiya noopo vanohalha aya umalha mahuku.<verse eid="1PE 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 1:6" />Nteelhiyeke wo yoyo nlhatu uyo etu, inakhalhaka wo mahuku vakani vano nnokhalha wo uchukulha ni uttwaruwa vanolhikachiya inyu wo iphiro chinchi. <verse eid="1PE 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 1:7" />Ulhikachiya winyu uwo uri wo nlhatu wo uhimiechesha ikekhiaye yo nrima inyu, ukhalhawaya ata nlhuku no idhahabu, ninolhiya ni nrenje ninolhikachiya vamooroni. Chiicho etu, mirima chinyu chinokhulhuvelhiya upwaha idhahabu, chinolhikachiya wiira chikhomaalhihiye. Umalhelha waya uwe waakhalha utotopelhiya ni uthimichiya ni uvahiya nthimicho nihuku Yesu Kuristo vanohalha awe upatakulhiya. <verse eid="1PE 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 1:8" />Mwaatti nnonttuna inakhalhaka khannapacha umwoona, munrumelhelhaka inakhalhaka khannomwoona. Paahi nnoteelhiya chinene wo nthimicho mwinchi uhinooria uhimiachiya, <verse eid="1PE 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 1:9" />ukhalhawaya nhopochera nttuvo no upisha nrima winyu, niri phi nlhatu wo woopolhiya winyu.<verse eid="1PE 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 1:10" />Wo yoyo noopo uyo etu, anamilhohi ahaaviavia ni ukohakoha chinene mwaha wo yoyo nnema wo uhiyereriya uwonya waalhohenre aya uyo, unohalha inyu uvahiya mwaatti ni Nlhuku. <verse eid="1PE 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 1:11" />Nkayaalhikacha ukoherera ikatema yaani ni iphiro chinohalha aya uwa. Yaani ikatema yaahimiye ni Iphumu ya Kuristo irii nhina mwaya vaahimmie aya ntwarusho unohalha awe upatta ni nthimicho unowa awe upatta. <verse eid="1PE 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 1:12" />Nlhuku ahaapatakulhelha anamilhohi wiira mitheko chaya khachari wo nlhatu wayaru, nansho wo nlhatu ninyu mwaatti thoko chihimiye ni Malhove Orera wo machiri o Iphumu ya Nlhuku ukhuma wiirimu. Ittu inothanana aya ata minepa o wiirimu wiiwa yoyo mwaha uyo.<verse eid="1PE 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Wiihaniya ukhalha Makhalhelho Matakatifu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 1:13" />Paahi etu, irusho chinyu chikhalheke tayari, nhiittialhe, nshiheke. Nkhulhuvelheke nnema uriyoothe nnohalha inyu uvahiya ikatema Yesu Kuristo vanohalha awe uwa tho. <verse eid="1PE 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 1:14" />Nkhalheke o wiiwelhelha thoko ashaana a Nlhuku, nhittwarettware tho nikakata no uhilhoka naarina inyu ikatema vaari inyu nhichuwelhaka ikeekhene ya Nlhuku. <verse eid="1PE 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 1:15" />Nansho meetelho inyu akhalheke matakatifu thoko Nlhuku owihanneni chiri awe. <verse eid="1PE 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 1:16" />Ukhalhawaya Malhove Matakatifu aholhepiya wiira, “Nnokhalha atakatifu ukhalhawaya ni Mii ki ntakatifu.”<verse eid="1PE 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 1:17" />Mwaatti vanonlhapelha inyu Nlhuku, nnomwiihana Thithi. Paahi etu nchuwelheke wiira yoyo phi nonhukumulha kila ntu wo uhimmweha wiitho wo mitheko chipannge awe. Paahi etu, nkhalheke rata mwiilhaponi mmwoovaka Nlhuku. <verse eid="1PE 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 1:18" />Ni inyu mwaatti nchuwelheke wiira khamwoopolhiye ukhuma mu uwonyani wo chittu chinotanganyia, wo isiliva mena idhahabu, wiira mwoorie ukhuma uri meetelho inyu uhinlhoka mpochenre inyu wa manyaapwiiya inyu. <verse eid="1PE 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 1:19" />Nansho mwoopolhiye wo iphome itakatifu ya Yesu Kuristo, Mwaana o Khondoro o uhiremara mena ukhalha ni nrottelha. <verse eid="1PE 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 1:20" />Yoyo phi athanlhiye ni Nlhuku ilhapo ihanaya wuupiya, nkaapatakulhiya mahuku ammalhelha alha wo nlhatu winyu mwaatti. <verse eid="1PE 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 1:21" />Wo iphiro awe, nnonrumelhelha Nlhuku anhihimunshe ni ummaha nthimicho. Paahi etu nrima ni ukhulhuvelha winyu ukhalheke wa Nlhuku.<verse eid="1PE 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 1:22" />Ukhalhawaya vano nheehapiha nhokhalha atakatifu wo urumelhelha winyu ikeekhene, paahi etu kila mmoka anttuneke nlhoko awe wo nrima woombone wo uhikhalha unafiki ni uttunana mwaashineneru. <verse eid="1PE 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1PE 1:23" />Ukhalhawaya wo iphiro yo nlhove nikumi na Nlhuku no mahuku o uhimalha, mwaatti nhoyaria tho, nhikhalhaka thoko nnyepu wo imbeyu inokhwa, nansho imbeyu yo ukumi. <verse eid="1PE 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1PE 1:24" />Thoko Malhove Matakatifu chinohimia aya wiira,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 1:24">“Kila ntu ri thoko nthaakhuru,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 1:24">Nthimicho wawe wonkhaye uri thoko ituva.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 1:24">Ukhawalhaya mathaakhuru anoonyalha ni ituva chinoomora.<verse eid="1PE 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1PE 1:25" />Nansho Nlhove na Athithi ninlhokelha mahuku o uhimalha.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1PE 1:25">Ni nenno nlhove nno phi Malhove Orera ahimeriye inyu.<verse eid="1PE 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1PE 2" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kuristo phi nlhuku nikumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 2:1" />Paahi etu nhiyeke uwonya uriwoothe ni woothacha ni unafiki ni ihache ni nuulhumo no uruwana. <verse eid="1PE 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 2:2" />Nkhalheke thoko ashaana ashikaani ayarelhe naanano, chinophavelha aya mapelhe, ni inyu chiicho mphavelheke mapelhe o uhithakanihiya o Iphumu ya Nlhuku, ikhalhe wiira mwawuriaka yayo munnuwe ni woopolhiya. <verse eid="1PE 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 2:3" />Thoko Malhove Matakatifu chinohimia aya, “Nhochuwelha vano wiira, Athithi phi orera.”<verse eid="1PE 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 2:4" />Mmweeke wa Athithi, nlhuku nikumi naakhotiye na attu nansho Nlhuku nkaathanlha nenno wiira phi nlhuku no ukhulhuvelhiya. <verse eid="1PE 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 2:5" />Ni inyu mmweeke thoko malhuku makumi athanlhiye utheka inupa yo Iphumu ya Nlhuku, nkhalhaka opochera ishaani atakatifu anokumiha isadaka cho munnepani chonteelhiha Nlhuku wo iphiro ya Yesu Kuristo. <verse eid="1PE 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 2:6" />Ukhalhawaya Malhove Matakatifu aholhepiya wiira,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 2:6">“Mwooneke! Kinoweemesha nlhuku no ukhulhuvelhiya Usayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 2:6">Nlhuku no nsingi no vakhoonani nithanlhiye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 2:6">Ni kila ntu nonrumelhelha yoyo khanoolhiya muru.”<verse eid="1PE 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 2:7" />Paahi etu uwaninyu mwaatti nnorumelhelha va, nna nlhuku nna phi no ukhulhuvelhiya thoko Malhove Matakatifu chinohimia aya. Nansho wa attu ahinrumelhelha</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 2:7">“Nlhuku nikhotilhe aya atheki wiira khaninlhoka</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 2:7">Nihothathuwa vano ukhalha phi nlhuku no ukhulhuvelhiya no nsingi.”<verse eid="1PE 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 2:8" />Tho vakittu vakina Malhove Matakatifu aneera,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 2:8">“Nna phi nlhuku ninokwakwathuwa aya attu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 2:8">Mwalha unaawulhusha attu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1PE 2:8">Attu anokwakwathuwa ukhalhawaya khanorumelhelha nttenga, phi chiichammo cheesheriye aya toka khalhayi.<verse eid="1PE 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 2:9" />Nansho mwaatti phi iyari ithanlhiye, opochera ishaani e imwene, nikosho nitakatifu nithanlhiye uvara mitheko cha Nlhuku, wiira nhimiache mitheko chawe owiihanneni nkhume mwiipiphini nkookelhihani munthukoni mwawe mwo ushangiha. <verse eid="1PE 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 2:10" />Khalhayi mwaatti khamwaari attu a Nlhuku nansho vano phi attu awe. Yeyo ikatema iyo Nlhuku khowonenlheni ikiriri nansho vano howoonelhani ikiriri.<verse eid="1PE 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Anamitheko a Nlhuku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 2:11" />Ashilhoko aka, kinoulhelhani thoko alheto ama attu o uvira velhaponi va! Nshembeke nikakata no mwiiruttuni nihinaathana ni minepa chinyu. <verse eid="1PE 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 2:12" />Mwaakhalhaneke rata attu ahinchuwenlhe Nlhuku, ikhalhe wiira ata yowootheriakani wiira nhowonya, awe anthimicha Nlhuku nihuku no uwa Athithi nno, vanohalha aya woona mitheko chinyu choombone.<verse eid="1PE 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 2:13" />Mwiiwelhelheke kila ittu inolheheriya ni attu, wo nlhatu na Athithi. Mweewelhelheke amwene arii ni ikuru yuulhupalhe, <verse eid="1PE 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 2:14" />ama attu anotawara athanlhiye ni Nlhuku wiira aatwarushe attu anopanga cho uhilhoka ni waatotopelha attu anopanga moombone. <verse eid="1PE 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 2:15" />Ukhalhawaya Nlhuku nothanana wiira mwaamaalhihe attu ahichuwenlhe ittu ni akumbafu vanopanga inyu chittu choombone. <verse eid="1PE 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 2:16" />Nkhalheke thoko aneethi ni uneethi inyu uyo uhikhalhe phi iphiro yo uvitha uhilhoka winyu. Nansho nkhalheke thoko anamitheko a Nlhuku. <verse eid="1PE 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 2:17" />Mwaathimicheke attu onkhaye. Mwaattuneke ashilhoko inyu. Munthimicheke Nlhuku. Mwaathimicheke amwene.<verse eid="1PE 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Malhikaaniho o uttwaruwa wa Kuristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 2:18" />Ni inyu ipotta va, mwaarumelhelheke rata manyaapwiiya inyu anourumani mitheko chaya. Nheewelhelhe attu o nrima woombone ama o maalha vekha ayaru nansho mweewelhelheke ni attu o mahuchuru ayo. <verse eid="1PE 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 2:19" />Ukhalhawaya wowo phi urera nrima, ntu avilhelhaka ntwarusho nihinophwanelhiya awe, wo uchuwelha wiira Nlhuku nowa ammaha ibarakha. <verse eid="1PE 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 2:20" />Ukhalhawaya nnohalha uttuviyani mwavilhelhaka ntwarusho no uwonya winyu? Nansho mwavilhelhaka vanotwarushiya inyu wo nlhatu wo upanga morera, Nlhuku nowa ovahani ibarakha wo nlhatu thoko yoyo.<verse eid="1PE 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 2:21" />Yayo phi ayo ehanelhiye inyu ukhalhawaya Kuristo ni uyo ahotwarushiya wo nlhatu winyu, nkoohiyerani nlhikaaniho, paahi etu muntwariheke. <verse eid="1PE 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 2:22" />Yoyo khaapannge ittu yo uwonya mena khoothanche vamalhakuni vawe. <verse eid="1PE 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1PE 2:23" />Vanruwanne aya khaakhunlhe nlhove no uhilhoka. Vaatwarushiya awe khoopopinhe attu nansho ankhulhuvenlhe Nlhuku, nohukumulha chittu we ikekhiaye. <verse eid="1PE 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1PE 2:24" />Kuristo mwanene ahokusha uwonya wihu mwiiruttuni mwawe vansalaabani, wiira nikhwe mu uwonyani, niwe naakhalha akumi mu ikekhiani. Wo waatiya wawe mwaatti nholhamihiya.<verse eid="1PE 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1PE 2:25" />Ukhalhawaya mwaatti mwaari ikhondoro chinothwelhelha nansho vano nhonhokolhelha Nshunga ni O weemelhelha ukumi inyu.<verse eid="1PE 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1PE 3" />
  <para style="s1">Manyopani ni manyottato</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 3:1" />Ni inyu manyoopani mwaathimicheke manyowannyu, yakhalhaka ahaawo manyottato ahinrumelhelha Nlhove na Nlhuku, awe ni ayo aarumelhelha wo meetelho inyu wo uhahimeria nlhove, <verse eid="1PE 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 3:2" />ukhalhawaya anowa yoona meetelho inyu o uhinanara ni o uthimichiya. <verse eid="1PE 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 3:3" />Wiireeriha winyu uhikhalhe wo wiipamba irutturu, wo utiva ikharari ni uwarelha chittu cho idhahabu ni ikuwo cho nhakhu, <verse eid="1PE 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 3:4" />nansho ukhalheke wo urera wo munrimani, urera uhinolhalha, yaani nrima wo mpuha ni wiitimarikha, unkhulhuvelhiya chinene mmiholho wa Nlhuku. <verse eid="1PE 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 3:5" />Chiichammo phi enre aya wo wiireriha manyoopani atakatifu o khalhayi vawo. Yaari ankhulhuvelhaka Nlhuku ni o waahelhelha manyowannyaya, <verse eid="1PE 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 3:6" />thoko chenre aya Asara. Wo waathimicha owannyaya Aburahimu, yeehana Pwiiya, ni inyu mwaatti phi achishaana aya mwapangaka moombone wo uhoova ittu iriyoothe.<verse eid="1PE 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 3:7" />Ni inyu manyottato chiicho, mwaakhalhaneke rata manyaahanu inyu, mwaalhoheke, mwoonaka thoko attu ihirina machiri thoko mwaattiva va, ni woona thoko ashikhunaninyu anohalha inyu waapocherana vamoka nnema wo ukumi ukhuma wa Nlhuku. Mwapangaka chiicho khiiwo ittu inohalha utiyelhelha ulhapelha winyu.<verse eid="1PE 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Uttwaruwa wo upanga moombone</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 3:8" />Wo umalhihera, kineera, mwaatti onkhaye va nkhalheke nlhoko wa attu o nrima mmoka, o woonelhana ikiriri, o uttunana mwaashineneru, o nrima woombone ni o wiitimarikha. <verse eid="1PE 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 3:9" />Nhaahokolhoshere chittu cho uhilhoka attu anoupangelhani chittu cho uhilhoka, ama uruwana thoko chinoruwaniya inyu nansho mwaalhapelheke attu ibarakha, ukhalhawaya yayo phi ehanelhiye inyu ni Nlhuku mmwe mwaapochera ibarakha. <verse eid="1PE 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 3:10" />Ukhalhawaya Malhove Matakatifu aneera,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 3:10">“Ntu nottuna ukumi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 3:10">Ni woona mahuku o mpuha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 3:10">Echinanelheke nlhimi nawe chinene, huulhumache malhove o unanara,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 3:10">Huulhumache malhove o woothacha.<verse eid="1PE 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 3:11" />Ahiyeke uwonya, apangeke moombone,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 3:11">Aavieke mpuha, aavieke chinene.<verse eid="1PE 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 3:12" />Ukhalhawaya miitho a Athithi anaaweha</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 3:12">attu o nrima worera,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 3:12">Anowewelhelha vanolhapelha aya, nansho ikohi ya Athithi inaakhota attu o uwonya.”<verse eid="1PE 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 3:13" />Mpani nohalha uupangelhani ichimwa mwavarecheshaka nrima wo upanga chittu choombone? <verse eid="1PE 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 3:14" />Nansho ata mwatwarushiyaka wo nlhatu no upanga chittu choombone chinothanana awe Nlhuku, nhoreeriya. Nhimwoove ntu riyoothe mena nhikelhiye nipampa, <verse eid="1PE 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 3:15" />nansho munthimicheke Kuristo mmamirimani mwinyu ukhalha phi Athithi mahuku onkhaye. Mwiicheesheke tayari umwaakhulha kila ntu nohalha uukohani makhulhuvelho arii mmamirimani mwinyu, <verse eid="1PE 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 3:16" />mwaakhulhaka rata ni wo wiitimarikha. Nkhalheke ni nrima woombone, ikhalhe wiira vanoruwaniya inyu, attu anoupangelhani ichimwa wo nlhatu no meetelho inyu oombone nhina Kuristo ayo, awe olhiya muru wo malhove anoolhumacha aya. <verse eid="1PE 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 3:17" />Ukhalhawaya iri nambaya uttwaruwa wo nlhatu no upanga moombone, Nlhuku attunaka, kuliko uttwaruwa wo upanga chittu cho uhilhoka.<verse eid="1PE 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 3:18" />Ukhalhawaya Kuristo ni uyo ahokhwa nkwaha mmoka tu wo nlhatu wo uhilhoka wa attu onkhaye. Ntu oombone ahaakhwelha attu o uwonya wiira aarweehe wa Nlhuku. Eeviye iruttu nansho nkaakhalha nkumi wo wooria wo Iphumu ya Nlhuku, <verse eid="1PE 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 3:19" />ni ahorwaa waahimiachera minepa chaari mu uttukiyani. <verse eid="1PE 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 3:20" />Yayo phi alhe minepa yaakhonte unrumelhelha Nlhuku vaaweherenre awe wo waavilhelha ikatema Anuhu vaakoorosha aya isafina. Nhina yeyo ikalhava iyo, attu vakani tu, attu nane phi yookokweelhe maashi. <verse eid="1PE 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 3:21" />Yayo maashi ayo yaalhikaanihiye ni ubatiizo unowoopolhani mwaatti vano. Kuhii ubatiizo wo urapa ni uchuururia nihiro mwiiruttuni nansho wo malhehano wa Nlhuku anopangiya wo nrima woombone, wo iphiro yo uhihimmwa wa Yesu Kuristo, <verse eid="1PE 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 3:22" />aarweelhe wiirimu, vano akhalhaka wiimonono wa Nlhuku, aatawaraka minepa ni ikuru ni machiri chikhalhaka mmathathani mwawe.<verse eid="1PE 3:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1PE 4" />
  <para style="s1">Ukhalha wo unkhulhuvelha Nlhuku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 4:1" />Paahi ukhalhawaya Kuristo aatwaruwilhe mwiiruttuni, paahi ni inyu vano etu mwiilhipiheke wo nrima thoko yoyo ukhalhawaya ntu twaruwilhe mwiiruttuni hohiya uwonya. <verse eid="1PE 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 4:2" />Toka vano etu, nhikhalhe nnikakatani mwo uhilhoka nansho mu uttunani mwa Nlhuku ikatema yuhalhenlheni mwiilhaponi mu. <verse eid="1PE 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 4:3" />Ukhalhawaya khalhayi mwahopanga chittu chinopangiya ni attu ahinchuwenlhe Nlhuku, vaattwara inyu ulhavalhava, nikakata no uhilhoka no mwiiruttuni, uwuria utheka ni uhapalhiya pufia, umenyekha, ni ulhapelha isinyago. <verse eid="1PE 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 4:4" />Vano attu ahinchuwenlhe Nlhuku ayo anooshanga vanowoonayani mwaatti nhaattukanaka mwommo nnovira aya ncharilhe chittu cho unanara chinene mmo. Vavawo phi nouruwanayani.<verse eid="1PE 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 4:5" />Nansho anowa wiivaraanga yoyo mwaha uyo wa Nlhuku, khanlhe tayari waahukumulha attu akumi ni attu akhwilhe. <verse eid="1PE 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 4:6" />Phi nlhatu etu Malhove Orera ahohimiachiya wa attu akhwilhe ayo wiira awe aahukumulhiya nookhwa wo mitheko chaya cho mwiiruttuni chipangilhe aya thoko chinohukumulhiya awe kila ntu. Nansho wo Iphumu ya Nlhuku awe yaakhalha akumi thoko Nlhuku chiri awe nkumi.<verse eid="1PE 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 4:7" />Umalha wo chittu chonkhaye uhaaya, paahi etu nkhalheke ni irusho, nshelhelhiheke nlhapelhaka. <verse eid="1PE 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 4:8" />Upwaha chittu chonkhaye chiyo, nttunaneke wo nrima wonkhaye, ukhalhawaya uttunana phi nokhuneelha uwonya winchi. <verse eid="1PE 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 4:9" />Mpocheraneke mwaashineneru umanupani winyu wo uhitukutuwacha. <verse eid="1PE 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 4:10" />Kila mmoka avarelheke mahalha avahiye awe ni Nlhuku thoko karumiya o ipilhi yoombone, o nnema wo waakavihera attu akina a Nlhuku. <verse eid="1PE 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 4:11" />Ntu olhumachaka Malhove a Nlhuku olhumacheke malhove anokhuma wa Nlhuku mwanene, akavihaka ntheko akaviheke wo machiri avahiye awe ni Nlhuku, ikhalhe iphiro yo uthimichiya Nlhuku wo iphiro yo Yesu Kuristo. Nthimicho ni wooria ukhalhe ni uyo wo mahuku o uhimalha! Aye.<verse eid="1PE 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Uttwaruwa wo nlhatu wo unrumelhelha Kuristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 4:12" />Ashilhoko aka, nhishange mwaha wo ulhikachiya winyu chinene mwoonaka thoko ittu ihinapacha inyu woona. <verse eid="1PE 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 4:13" />Nansho nteelhiyeke ukhalhawaya nnookaviha uttwaruwa wa Kuristo wiira mmwe mwaateelhiya chinene ikatema vanohalha awe uhokolhia wo nthimicho wawe. <verse eid="1PE 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 4:14" />Mwaruwaniyaka wo nlhatu wo urumelhelha nchina na Kuristo nhoreeriya, ukhalhawaya Iphumu yo nthimicho iri phi Iphumu ya Nlhuku rii vamoka ni inyu. <verse eid="1PE 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 4:15" />Hikhalhe ntu riyoothe munlhokoni mwinyu notwarushiya wo nlhatu wo ukhalha ntu owiiva ama ntu owiiya ama ntu otteka ama ntu noolhumacha chittu cha attu wiira aanihe. <verse eid="1PE 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 4:16" />Nansho mwatwaruwaka wo nlhatu wo unrumelhelha Kuristo, paahi etu nhuulhiye muru nansho nthepiheke unthimicha Nlhuku, ukhalhawaya nneehaniya wo nchina na Kuristo.<verse eid="1PE 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 4:17" />Ikatema yo uhukumulhiya ihaatameria, ni uhukumulhiya unochokholha wa nlhoko wa attu a Nlhuku mwanene. Yakhalhaka uhukumulhiya unochokholha uwanihu hii, paahi etu, umalha waya unohalha ukhalha chani wa attu ahinrumelhelha Malhove Orera a Nlhuku? <verse eid="1PE 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 4:18" />Thoko Malhove Matakatifu chinohimia aya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 4:18">“Yakhalhaka inoorika wa attu anopanga chittu choombone mmiholho wa Nlhuku woopolhiya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 4:18">Inohalha ukhalha chani etu wa attu ahinonthimicha Nlhuku</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 4:18">ni wa attu o uwonya?”<verse eid="1PE 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 4:19" />Paahi etu, attu anotwaruwa wo uttuna wa Nlhuku, eesheke ukumi aya mmathathani mwawe Nrata aya o ukhulhuvelhiya ni uthepiha upanga mitheko choombone.<verse eid="1PE 4:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1PE 5" />
  <para style="s1">Nlhoko wa attu anomwiiwelhelha Nlhuku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 5:1" />Mii owulhuvalha ni nholhelhi o nlhoko wa attu anrumelhenlhe Kuristo nkhunaninyu, ahimiechenshe Kuristo vaatwaruwilhe awe ni ntu kinohalha ukavihana munthimichoni nnohalha upatakulhiya kaanyuma. Kinoulhepelhani chinene mwaatti ashulhupalhe ahoolhelhi ashikhunanaka wiira, <verse eid="1PE 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 5:2" />nshungeke nlhoko wa attu a Nlhuku avahiye inyu waashunga ni weemelhelha. Mwaashungeke wo uhikhanyererihiya nansho wo uttuna winyu thoko chinottuna awe Nlhuku. Kuhii wo nlhulha wo upatta nchurukhu nansho wo nrima winyu wonkhaye. <verse eid="1PE 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 5:3" />Nhaaholhelhe wo machiri attu anaashunga inyu nansho nkhalheke malhikaaniho o utwariya ni yoyo nlhoko uyo. <verse eid="1PE 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 5:4" />Ikatema Nshunga Mulhupalhe vanohalha awe uwa vawo, inyu mwaatti nnoowa mwaattukiya mphumburu wo nthimicho uhinothaalha.<verse eid="1PE 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 5:5" />Ni inyu ashimirawo va, mweewelhelheke ashulhupalhe ahoolhelhi. Eiyo, mwaattiva onkhaye va mwiitimarikheke mwaashineneru ni ukavihana ukhalhawaya Malhove Matakatifu aneera,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 5:5">“Nlhuku nowaavinga attu o wiichoona</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 5:5">Nansho nowaavaha nnema attu o wiitimarikha.”<verse eid="1PE 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 5:6" />Paahi etu mwiitimarikheke mmoononi mwa Nlhuku nri mwo machiri, awe otheeshani ikatema aya yaayaka. <verse eid="1PE 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 5:7" />Munhiyereke nipampa ninyu nonkhaye ukhalhawaya yoyo phi noushungani.<verse eid="1PE 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 5:8" />Nhiittialhe, nshelhelhiheke! Ukhalhawaya mmalhaponi inyu, Nakare noorukureriacha thoko kharamu noturuma alhupattaka ampatte ntu ankhuure nfiaa. <verse eid="1PE 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 5:9" />Ni inyu mwaatti nlhipeke nrima, munvingeke, nchuwelhaka wiira uttwaruwa thoko wowo phi naapatta ashilhoko inyu arii velhaponi va. <verse eid="1PE 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 5:10" />Nansho mwaatti nnotwaruwa vakani va, Nlhuku ri machokholhelho o nnema wonkhaye owiihanneni mwaatti mu nthimichoni mwawe mahuku o uhimalha nhina Kuristo Yesu, nowa olhipihani kabisaa ni uvahani ikuru ni machiri ni ukhalha nsingi wo ukhomaalha. <verse eid="1PE 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 5:11" />Machiri akhalhe uwannyawe mahuku o uhimalha! Aye.<verse eid="1PE 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isalamu cho umalhihera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 5:12" />Wo moono wa Nasuluwano, kinomwaalhakelha aka ukhalha munnaka o ukhulhuvelhiya kiholhepa iwarakha yo malhove vakani ilha wiira kuuhelheni nrima wo uhimiechesha wiira ulha phi nnema we ikeekhene wa Nlhuku. Mweemelhelheke rata yoyo nrima uyo.<verse eid="1PE 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 5:13" />Nkutiro wa attu anonrumelhelha Kuristo naninyu o va vaneehana aka Babeli va, athanlhiye vamoka ni inyu mwaatti anouvahani isalamu. Anaaka Namako chiicho anouvahani isalamu. <verse eid="1PE 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 5:14" />Nshikurianeke kila mmoka wo nrima wo uttunana.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1PE 5:14">Mpuha ukhalhe ni inyu mwaatti onkhaye nri awawe Kuristo va. Aye.<verse eid="1PE 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 5" />
</usx>